# Sky Apex: what does NOT go into the repository (see CLAUDE.md, «Qué no está en el repo»).
# GitHub limit: no file over 100 MB.

# Heavy originals and reference material (to use them on another PC: OneDrive or an external disk)
/source_assets/
*.stl
*.STL
*.obj
*.OBJ
*.fbx
*.FBX
*.zip
*.rar
*.7z
*.blend
*.blend1
/*.pdf
/*.mp4
/*.webm
/*.mp3

# Generated, or specific to each PC
/dev.html
node_modules/
__pycache__/
/tools/output/
/tools/blender/output/
/tools/blender/local_paths.txt
/.claude/settings.local.json
/.claude/worktrees/

# Lock file that Excel creates while the workbook is open
~$*
